{"3937830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cozy Rabbit Hole", "steam_appid": 3937830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategy first!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Rabbit Hole is a 2D survival horror game. Success requires strategic thinking and preparation, not  quick reflexes or precise platforming. Be smart, be curious, but don't be reckless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;There are no solutions, only trade-offs.&quot;-</i>Thomas Sowell-</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, your objective is to find sufficient food, water and oil before winter hits. However, water and oil are required when crafting useful objects. Be mindful, not wasteful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The two-fold threat in the rabbit holes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rabbit holes are crowded with different types of creatures, who all have their own strengths, weaknesses and behavioural patterns. That said, the real final boss is scarcity. You will be saved when a creature catches you, but nothing will save you from starvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FAQ with Cynthia and Slibbiddy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937830/extras/f0cb58081002a1f160a0d98d991055a7.avif?t=1784322790\" width=780 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937830/extras/14b79a1585205af7cf67b09280c6479e.avif?t=1784322790\" width=780 height=283 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937830/extras/0749febb67395ef098b22b60b3629e2c.avif?t=1784322790\" width=780 height=788 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Strategy first!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Rabbit Hole is a 2D survival horror game. Success requires strategic thinking and preparation, not  quick reflexes or precise platforming. Be smart, be curious, but don't be reckless!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;There are no solutions, only trade-offs.&quot;-</i>Thomas Sowell-</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, your objective is to find sufficient food, water and oil before winter hits. However, water and oil are required when crafting useful objects. Be mindful, not wasteful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The two-fold threat in the rabbit holes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rabbit holes are crowded with different types of creatures, who all have their own strengths, weaknesses and behavioural patterns. That said, the real final boss is scarcity. You will be saved when a creature catches you, but nothing will save you from starvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FAQ with Cynthia and Slibbiddy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937830/extras/f0cb58081002a1f160a0d98d991055a7.avif?t=1784322790\" width=780 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937830/extras/14b79a1585205af7cf67b09280c6479e.avif?t=1784322790\" width=780 height=283 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937830/extras/0749febb67395ef098b22b60b3629e2c.avif?t=1784322790\" width=780 height=788 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Cozy Rabbit Hole is a 2D survival horror game. Explore the deep rabbit holes, fight or dodge monsters, gather resources, craft weapons and power-ups. Balance curiosity with caution, and find enough supplies to survive the harsh winter.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Vietnamese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937830/7f0311dc242f7ce129dd5d29ce96f74fa13a66d4/header.jpg?t=1784322790", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937830/aa289aad6a0ba7183fd375d65ae5572853ed77f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784322790", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937830/aa289aad6a0ba7183fd375d65ae5572853ed77f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784322790", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 7 3700 X<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</s